1794960668753104	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-39v	{"body":"Merged to main in d4de0d5 (scope init/questions/check/compile, staleness sidecar, advisor integration; 52 tests). Review fixes: generated expectations no longer require DTMF (a baseline call sends none), and source addresses must include the local capture-side address behind NAT. Known limits: the profile carries only the first target; reject destinations get no final-status expectation; a compiled campaign for an account-requiring target still cannot run until bn-1c5 lands."}	blake3:o0EJ4L3LQ-xN5uOG9IsWEhuPAz47e2EgeEdWt2Tfk3E
